  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "# Idea:\n\nAllow to select photos from your Gallery to be featured in your profile.\n\n# Implementation:\n\nMaybe as a section underneath the bio, similar to the list of uploaded worlds by the specific user - header + grid of pictures.\n\n# Reasoning:\n\nA cosmetic feature that plays well with the expressiveness and creativity of the platform, by allowing you to customize your profile and presentation with cool photos of e.g. your avatars, worlds, friends, favorite activities or maybe a DJ logo or a poster for a group/event you are running. Increasing the personal factor and making it more interesting to browse and get to know people.\n\nKinda bringing the user viewing experience closer to Steam profiles and their sections in a way.\n\nVRChat already provides a wide range of possibilities to express yourself and user profiles should allow that too. Especially when it could be used to also promote and fuel engagement for initiatives related to the game.",
